Upstream default PrometheusRule bundle

This bundle is derived from the Apache-2.0-licensed kube-prometheus-stack
91.8.0 chart maintained by the Prometheus Community:
https://github.com/prometheus-community/helm-charts/tree/kube-prometheus-stack-91.8.0/charts/kube-prometheus-stack

The chart's source templates identify the maintained rule groups generated
from prometheus-operator/kube-prometheus:
https://github.com/prometheus-operator/kube-prometheus

Each resource retains its upstream chart-template source comment. The
rule specifications and selector/provenance labels are unchanged. The
first-party integration changes only app.kubernetes.io/managed-by from
Helm to kustomize-controller and separates Rule reconciliation from the
chart release so that admission readiness can be ordered explicitly.

The upstream Apache-2.0 license is reproduced in LICENSE. The chart archive
contains no separate NOTICE file. See provenance.json for frozen inputs,
output hashes and the scope of local verification.
